# Netlify redirect rules
# Force all traffic to hsid.kr (canonical domain) with 301 permanent redirect.
# The "!" at the end of status code forces the redirect even if the destination exists.

# 1) Force netlify.app subdomain to hsid.kr
https://hansong-industry.netlify.app/*    https://hsid.kr/:splat    301!
http://hansong-industry.netlify.app/*     https://hsid.kr/:splat    301!

# 2) Force http to https on hsid.kr
http://hsid.kr/*                          https://hsid.kr/:splat    301!

# 3) (Optional) If you also have www.hsid.kr, force to non-www
http://www.hsid.kr/*                      https://hsid.kr/:splat    301!
https://www.hsid.kr/*                     https://hsid.kr/:splat    301!
